WEBVTT

01:29.270 --> 01:34.310
[Never-Ending Summer]

01:35.780 --> 01:38.030
[Episode 16]

01:38.140 --> 01:42.350
[Outpatient Clinic; Outpatient Building]

01:51.910 --> 01:52.620
Lu Xixiao,

01:55.250 --> 01:56.910
I prepared breakfast for you.

01:58.930 --> 01:59.789
It's inside.

02:00.510 --> 02:01.150
Come in.

02:15.250 --> 02:16.510
It tastes good, right?

02:21.000 --> 02:22.329
You come here every day;

02:22.380 --> 02:23.380
aren't you tired?

02:24.360 --> 02:26.380
Taking care of someone is more tiring.

02:26.380 --> 02:28.120
Hurry up and eat your breakfast.

02:28.120 --> 02:29.380
You can't skip breakfast.

02:29.380 --> 02:31.579
It's the most important meal of the day.

02:33.300 --> 02:35.710
Calcium-enriched premium ham sausage.

02:37.510 --> 02:39.170
You used to eat this every day?

02:39.950 --> 02:40.760
What's wrong?

02:41.420 --> 02:42.510
I went through

02:42.560 --> 02:43.800
every convenience store around here

02:43.800 --> 02:44.850
to pick the best ones.

02:44.850 --> 02:46.380
All my personal favorites.

02:47.060 --> 02:48.540
Zhou Wan's top picks.

02:52.600 --> 02:55.010
Let me try Zhou Wan's top picks.

02:58.900 --> 02:59.730
I have to

03:00.100 --> 03:02.430
take my grandpa out of the hospital later.

03:02.690 --> 03:03.620
So sudden?

03:06.200 --> 03:07.510
He probably thinks

03:07.870 --> 03:08.710
a day like today

03:08.710 --> 03:09.680
is better spent

03:09.680 --> 03:11.280
recovering at the old house.

03:11.800 --> 03:12.310
After all, there's no reason

03:12.310 --> 03:13.520
for the father to be in the hospital

03:13.520 --> 03:14.310
while his son

03:14.310 --> 03:15.840
is getting married at home.

03:19.500 --> 03:20.700
The wedding is today?

03:23.730 --> 03:24.730
Aren't you going?

03:26.240 --> 03:27.110
Why would I go?

03:27.340 --> 03:28.400
To crash the party?

03:32.490 --> 03:33.560
Then you probably

03:33.560 --> 03:36.490
won't come to the hospital anymore
during this time.

03:36.720 --> 03:37.470
Then I will

03:37.470 --> 03:38.800
go visit Dr. Chen later.

03:39.720 --> 03:42.380
He took great care of Grandma
when she was alive.

03:42.690 --> 03:43.250
Okay.

03:44.000 --> 03:45.190
Tell me when you're done,

03:45.190 --> 03:46.190
and we'll go home.

03:47.480 --> 03:48.090
Okay.

03:50.680 --> 03:51.940
Go back to our own home.

03:54.390 --> 03:55.390
Wipe your mouth.

04:11.470 --> 04:12.120
Hello.

04:12.360 --> 04:13.450
How can I help you?

04:13.800 --> 04:15.050
I'm looking for Dr. Chen.

04:15.050 --> 04:15.730
Dr. Chen

04:15.760 --> 04:17.290
just went to the cafeteria.

04:17.510 --> 04:18.920
I just came from the cafeteria.

04:18.920 --> 04:19.920
I didn't see him.

04:20.250 --> 04:21.490
He just left too.

04:23.110 --> 04:23.740
Thank you.

04:23.770 --> 04:24.380
It's okay.

04:39.760 --> 04:41.090
Mr. Lu's wedding today

04:41.120 --> 04:42.680
is quite a big affair.

04:42.710 --> 04:44.390
But his new wife

04:44.490 --> 04:46.220
has still been running around taking care of
her father-in-law in the hospital,

04:46.220 --> 04:47.159
and it hasn't delayed

04:47.159 --> 04:48.270
the wedding at all.

04:49.159 --> 04:50.960
She is Mr. Lu's new wife?

04:51.159 --> 04:51.830
But a couple of days ago,

04:51.830 --> 04:53.580
she was still visiting
one of Dr. Chen's patients—

04:53.580 --> 04:55.310
the elderly Mrs. Huang Xuefen.

04:55.600 --> 04:56.800
You didn't know?

04:56.800 --> 04:57.600
She used to be

04:57.600 --> 04:59.700
Director Zhou's wife.

05:01.400 --> 05:02.950
Back then, Director Zhou

05:03.210 --> 05:05.010
passed away in our hospital too.

05:05.220 --> 05:06.920
He was a really good man.

05:07.320 --> 05:08.650
The factory collapsed,

05:08.680 --> 05:09.830
but he insisted on paying off

05:09.830 --> 05:10.800
all his debts.

05:11.090 --> 05:12.070
In the end,

05:12.070 --> 05:13.600
he worked himself to death.

05:13.940 --> 05:15.840
Actually, there was a chance

05:15.870 --> 05:17.070
for him to have surgery.

05:17.070 --> 05:19.000
But maybe the burden was too heavy,

05:19.320 --> 05:21.000
so his wife gave up.

05:26.140 --> 05:28.070
Let's not talk about this anymore.

05:28.620 --> 05:29.120
Yes.

05:29.120 --> 05:30.830
We should respect the family's choice.

05:30.830 --> 05:31.300
Yes.

05:31.320 --> 05:31.850
Alright.

05:31.880 --> 05:32.870
I have things to do, so I'll leave first.

05:32.870 --> 05:33.500
You guys keep chatting.

05:33.500 --> 05:34.560
Goodbye, Dr. Chen.

05:40.510 --> 05:41.430
Wan?

05:42.860 --> 05:44.150
So back then,

05:46.720 --> 05:47.720
my dad

05:47.720 --> 05:49.240
could've survived,

05:51.159 --> 05:52.080
couldn't he?

05:53.280 --> 05:54.280
Not necessarily.

05:54.960 --> 05:56.690
By then it was already too late.

05:57.360 --> 05:58.960
The cancer cells had spread.

05:59.070 --> 06:00.560
Even if the surgery had been successful,

06:00.560 --> 06:02.310
without proper follow-up treatment,

06:02.310 --> 06:04.910
he probably wouldn't have
lasted much longer.

06:06.920 --> 06:07.970
At least

06:08.810 --> 06:10.960
he could have lived a bit longer.

06:12.900 --> 06:13.660
Right?

06:15.480 --> 06:16.280
Wan,

06:17.670 --> 06:19.180
you were just a child then.

06:20.190 --> 06:21.110
And your dad

06:21.130 --> 06:22.860
had already lost hope himself.

06:23.190 --> 06:24.580
He was the one who told me

06:24.630 --> 06:26.490
not to tell you how serious it was.

06:48.440 --> 06:49.610
Mom,

06:49.950 --> 06:51.270
Dad passed away.

06:51.290 --> 06:52.840
Aren't you sad?

06:52.920 --> 06:53.680
Why don't you ask him

06:53.680 --> 06:54.740
how heartless he was?

06:54.740 --> 06:55.570
We never had a single

06:55.570 --> 06:56.670
good day together.

06:56.720 --> 06:58.480
Now he's left us behind.

06:58.960 --> 07:00.190
You love asking him so much, huh?

07:00.190 --> 07:01.270
Then go ask him.

07:01.270 --> 07:03.070
Wake him up and ask him yourself!

07:03.740 --> 07:04.690
Wan,

07:08.650 --> 07:09.510
sweetheart...

07:14.920 --> 07:20.460
[Supporting Employees, Promoting Health]

07:20.850 --> 07:22.780
After all those years of hardship,

07:23.230 --> 07:25.130
I can take this money
with a clear conscience.

07:25.130 --> 07:26.210
What about Wan?

07:27.330 --> 07:28.690
What do you mean by that?

07:29.060 --> 07:30.610
Are you trying to guilt-trip me?

07:30.610 --> 07:31.950
How am I guilt-tripping you?

07:31.950 --> 07:33.480
That's exactly what you're doing.

07:33.480 --> 07:34.630
Do you expect me

07:34.630 --> 07:35.950
to stay with the Zhou family
for the rest of my life?

07:35.950 --> 07:36.630
Am I supposed to be trapped here

07:36.630 --> 07:37.870
forever?

07:37.890 --> 07:38.490
You...

08:04.170 --> 08:04.700
Dad,

08:05.070 --> 08:06.770
I will get justice for you.

08:13.530 --> 08:14.820
My dear grandson,

08:15.170 --> 08:17.230
you know how to care for your grandpa now.

08:17.230 --> 08:18.540
I didn't spoil you for nothing.

08:18.540 --> 08:20.010
Go back and get some rest, Grandpa.

08:20.010 --> 08:20.570
Okay.

08:23.040 --> 08:24.390
All right, you don't need to see me off.

08:24.390 --> 08:24.950
Grandpa.

08:29.520 --> 08:30.840
My dear grandson.

08:32.809 --> 08:33.770
That's it.

08:34.620 --> 08:36.950
Should I still go to the wedding, Grandpa?

08:37.270 --> 08:38.580
Go if you want,

08:38.600 --> 08:40.400
and don't go if you don't want to.

08:40.909 --> 08:41.510
Okay.

08:41.750 --> 08:42.270
Bye.

08:42.289 --> 08:42.799
Okay.

08:54.050 --> 08:54.760
Dr. Chen.

08:55.970 --> 08:57.650
It's you, young man.

08:58.240 --> 09:00.500
Have you finished talking with Zhou Wan?

09:05.870 --> 09:06.690
Hello, Mr. Zhang.

09:06.690 --> 09:07.320
Hello, Mr. Lu.

09:07.320 --> 09:08.000
Congratulations.

09:08.000 --> 09:08.720
Thank you.

09:08.720 --> 09:09.150
Congratulations.

09:09.150 --> 09:09.910
The drinks are over there.

09:09.910 --> 09:11.000
We'll talk later.

09:11.270 --> 09:11.960
Come.

09:11.990 --> 09:12.990
This way, please.

09:13.040 --> 09:13.550
Lu.

09:13.550 --> 09:13.910
Mr. Chang.

09:13.910 --> 09:14.770
Happy wedding.

09:15.320 --> 09:16.750
Let's have a hug.

09:16.790 --> 09:18.520
You've got good news every day.

09:18.670 --> 09:20.270
Business is thriving,
your family's doing great—

09:20.270 --> 09:20.870
seems like all the good fortune
in the world

09:20.870 --> 09:21.720
ends up with you.

09:21.720 --> 09:22.870
What do you mean all the good fortune

09:22.870 --> 09:24.200
ends up with me?

09:24.650 --> 09:26.330
Every family has its own problems.

09:26.330 --> 09:27.720
Still, I think if a family

09:27.720 --> 09:29.150
never argues or bickers,

09:29.150 --> 09:30.230
can you really call it a family?

09:30.230 --> 09:30.960
Otherwise, I might as well

09:30.960 --> 09:32.090
sleep at the office.

09:32.720 --> 09:33.600
That's true.

09:33.600 --> 09:35.000
We're in the home-furnishings business.

09:35.000 --> 09:36.150
If we never go home,

09:36.150 --> 09:37.750
who are we supposed to
sell our products to?

09:37.750 --> 09:38.480
Mr. Chang,

09:38.480 --> 09:41.030
real estate and home furnishings
go hand in hand.

09:41.030 --> 09:42.320
As long as you've got the home right,

09:42.320 --> 09:44.450
the business will take care of itself.

09:44.750 --> 09:46.030
Here, let me toast you.

09:46.030 --> 09:46.480
Good.

09:46.480 --> 09:47.000
Here.

09:47.080 --> 09:47.960
Happy wedding.

09:50.910 --> 09:51.870
Just look at this.

09:51.870 --> 09:53.390
The trouble's practically

09:53.390 --> 09:54.820
at your doorstep,

09:55.240 --> 09:57.720
and you're still sitting here
waiting for the banquet to start.

09:57.720 --> 09:58.270
It's just a wedding.

09:58.270 --> 09:59.870
What's there to gloat about?

09:59.870 --> 10:02.200
The real trouble usually comes from home.

10:03.960 --> 10:05.020
Hello, do you have an invitation?

10:05.020 --> 10:05.670
Hello,

10:06.550 --> 10:07.240
do you have an invitation?

10:07.240 --> 10:08.480
You can't enter without an invitation.

10:08.480 --> 10:09.800
I am the bride's daughter.

10:09.800 --> 10:11.530
Why would I need an invitation?

10:12.100 --> 10:13.030
What's going on?

10:17.320 --> 10:18.110
Mrs. Lu,

10:18.130 --> 10:19.070
congratulations.

10:19.070 --> 10:21.340
We were just praising you
for your kind heart.

10:21.340 --> 10:23.080
And look—one of the students

10:23.080 --> 10:25.140
you've been sponsoring has shown up.

10:25.630 --> 10:27.360
You... Why are you here?

10:29.220 --> 10:30.950
Why did you go to see my grandma?

10:31.550 --> 10:32.880
What do you mean by that?

10:33.360 --> 10:34.670
Today is my wedding.

10:34.670 --> 10:36.000
Please be considerate.

10:36.610 --> 10:39.010
You know that's not
what I'm talking about.

10:41.240 --> 10:43.000
I couldn't make it
to your grandma's funeral

10:43.000 --> 10:44.260
because I was too busy.

10:44.400 --> 10:45.120
Alright, alright.

10:45.120 --> 10:45.910
I'll have someone find you a seat.

10:45.910 --> 10:46.840
Did my grandma‘s giving up treatment

10:46.840 --> 10:48.770
have anything to do with you or not?

10:57.420 --> 10:58.550
Did my grandma giving up treatment

10:58.550 --> 11:00.030
have anything to do with you or not?

11:00.030 --> 11:00.910
Tell me!

11:02.160 --> 11:03.890
What does your grandma's death

11:03.940 --> 11:05.680
have to do with me?

11:06.550 --> 11:08.440
You came to my wedding now;

11:08.460 --> 11:09.660
what do you want to do?

11:11.600 --> 11:12.660
What do I want to do?

11:14.530 --> 11:15.650
What can I do?

11:15.860 --> 11:17.440
-I just want the truth!
-Miss Zhou.

11:17.440 --> 11:17.870
Miss Zhou,

11:17.870 --> 11:18.670
please calm down.

11:18.670 --> 11:19.320
There are a lot of people today.

11:19.320 --> 11:21.520
-Wait.
-There are a lot of people today.

11:24.340 --> 11:25.540
Mr. Lu, do you need...

11:26.670 --> 11:27.460
Zhou Wan,

11:29.250 --> 11:31.150
I cut off your financial support

11:31.630 --> 11:33.000
because you didn't even take

11:33.000 --> 11:34.530
the college entrance exam.

11:35.440 --> 11:37.150
I wanted to teach you a lesson

11:37.330 --> 11:39.260
and get you back on the right track.

11:40.190 --> 11:41.460
What are you doing?

11:41.960 --> 11:43.390
I never imagined

11:43.390 --> 11:44.550
you'd come to my wedding

11:44.550 --> 11:45.950
and slander me like this.

11:48.260 --> 11:49.790
Do you have a conscience?

11:50.150 --> 11:51.150
So now you're turning this around on me?

11:51.150 --> 11:52.030
Do you have a conscience?

11:52.030 --> 11:53.720
You're turning this around on me?

11:53.720 --> 11:54.910
Do you have a conscience?

11:54.910 --> 11:55.770
Guo Xiangling!

11:55.840 --> 11:57.240
Quick, drag her away!

11:57.240 --> 11:57.840
People like you

11:57.840 --> 11:59.320
don't care who's right or wrong.

11:59.320 --> 12:00.000
You just can't stand the thought

12:00.000 --> 12:01.270
of a poor student

12:01.360 --> 12:02.080
tarnishing the image

12:02.080 --> 12:03.410
of your distinguished Mrs. Lu!

12:03.410 --> 12:04.670
Who dares to touch her?

12:19.720 --> 12:20.720
Are you two blind?

12:20.750 --> 12:21.440
Don't you know who I am?

12:21.440 --> 12:22.150
Lu Xixiao!

12:22.820 --> 12:23.950
Stop making a scene!

12:24.690 --> 12:25.870
The two of you make quite a pair.

12:25.870 --> 12:27.530
Who here has a clean record?

12:28.270 --> 12:29.440
You cheated on your wife back then

12:29.440 --> 12:30.120
and forced my mom to death.

12:30.120 --> 12:31.250
Have you forgotten?

12:32.240 --> 12:33.900
No wonder you two are a couple.

12:43.270 --> 12:45.910
I haven't even had the chance
to congratulate you.

12:45.910 --> 12:46.550
I also don't understand

12:46.550 --> 12:47.480
what's so good about entering

12:47.480 --> 12:49.340
this rotten place, the Lu family.

12:49.670 --> 12:51.030
One was my mom,
the other was Jiang Wensheng.

12:51.030 --> 12:53.020
Which one of them ever ended up happy?

12:53.020 --> 12:55.950
I'll be waiting to see you
follow in their footsteps.

12:56.260 --> 12:56.970
Get out!

12:58.250 --> 12:58.930
Let's go.

13:40.270 --> 13:41.060
Alright.

13:41.190 --> 13:42.740
It's all right now.

13:43.060 --> 13:44.880
It's nothing. Enjoy your meal, everyone.

13:44.880 --> 13:46.220
Just a little hiccup.

14:17.130 --> 14:18.300
What are you doing?

14:28.010 --> 14:28.720
Painting.

14:31.630 --> 14:32.490
Painting what?

14:33.790 --> 14:34.390
Anger.

14:39.870 --> 14:40.600
Try it.

14:48.710 --> 14:49.360
Again.

14:54.810 --> 14:55.570
Like this.

15:04.340 --> 15:04.980
Again.

15:14.620 --> 15:18.340
♪ Are you out there waiting for me ♪

15:19.860 --> 15:22.510
♪ Through the dark, bravely, steadily ♪

15:21.020 --> 15:21.710
Zhou Wan,

15:23.030 --> 15:24.360
stop keeping everything

15:24.360 --> 15:25.540
bottled up.

15:24.490 --> 15:27.600
♪ If I could run and land with you ♪

15:27.390 --> 15:28.790
You don't have to act like

15:28.790 --> 15:29.960
a calm, composed adult.

15:29.560 --> 15:32.490
♪ After the long night ♪

15:29.960 --> 15:31.110
in front of me.

15:34.180 --> 15:36.360
♪ I'll find my way, no more lost inside ♪

15:37.100 --> 15:38.190
You can be yourself.

15:37.240 --> 15:40.410
♪ Thinking about ♪

15:39.280 --> 15:40.550
You can let it out.

15:40.630 --> 15:41.750
You can lose your temper if you want.

15:41.750 --> 15:42.890
It's okay.

15:42.020 --> 15:45.590
♪ Fulfilling the last promise ♪

15:47.610 --> 15:49.830
♪ We've both held fragility ♪

15:49.890 --> 15:51.260
♪ Talked through our misery ♪

15:51.390 --> 15:54.110
♪ This time
I'm holding tight to your will ♪

15:55.650 --> 15:57.690
♪ Lighting up all the sparks ♪

15:57.810 --> 16:01.730
♪ Hoping it doesn't slip away ♪

16:03.040 --> 16:04.780
♪ In this boring universe ♪

16:04.870 --> 16:06.420
♪ Drifting day by day ♪

16:06.560 --> 16:10.750
♪ Until the day I choose
to break away for you ♪

16:08.600 --> 16:09.960
Mr. Lu went back to the company

16:09.960 --> 16:11.480
to deal with important work.

16:11.480 --> 16:12.840
He won't be coming back tonight.

16:12.840 --> 16:14.080
Then I'll go find him

16:14.080 --> 16:15.280
and explain it to him.

16:15.840 --> 16:17.370
Mr. Lu is very busy tonight.

16:17.440 --> 16:19.030
He has no time to see you.

16:21.840 --> 16:23.960
Then I will wait for him here

16:23.960 --> 16:25.320
until he's done.

16:26.000 --> 16:27.810
There might not be time for that.

16:27.910 --> 16:29.150
Mr. Lu has already booked you

16:29.150 --> 16:30.850
a flight for tomorrow morning

16:30.960 --> 16:32.020
to go somewhere and clear your head.

16:32.020 --> 16:34.150
I'll come pick you up on time tomorrow.

16:38.390 --> 16:39.790
You don't stutter.

16:52.150 --> 16:52.910
My dad

16:52.910 --> 16:54.240
could have survived.

16:57.670 --> 16:58.720
He could have

16:58.720 --> 17:00.240
had a chance to survive.

17:16.310 --> 17:17.000
I'm here.

17:18.410 --> 17:20.099
I'm with you, Zhou Wan.

17:35.550 --> 17:36.360
It's okay.

17:36.670 --> 17:37.620
It's okay.

17:38.640 --> 17:39.520
I'm with you.

17:41.880 --> 17:44.140
But after summer vacation,

17:45.590 --> 17:47.160
aren't you leaving too?

17:52.820 --> 17:54.480
I'm not going abroad anymore.

18:06.300 --> 18:07.900
I've decided a long time ago.

18:08.450 --> 18:10.010
I just haven't told you yet.

18:11.830 --> 18:13.090
I want to keep painting

18:14.110 --> 18:15.530
and staying by your side.

18:17.110 --> 18:18.510
Not just for this summer.

18:20.200 --> 18:21.390
I will always be there from now on.

18:21.390 --> 18:22.330
I promise you.

18:34.940 --> 18:35.720
Zhou Wan,

18:36.320 --> 18:37.450
I'll grow up with you

18:37.830 --> 18:39.490
and stay with you as we grow up.

18:42.180 --> 18:43.390
We still have time.

18:43.800 --> 18:45.060
We still have a future.

18:45.350 --> 18:46.880
Nothing is set in stone yet.

18:47.360 --> 18:49.560
It's never too late to change anything.

18:58.930 --> 19:01.220
Lu Zhongyue is getting married again.

19:03.330 --> 19:04.750
He might even have more
children in the future

19:04.750 --> 19:05.590
who knows?

19:12.800 --> 19:14.470
You need to study hard

19:14.730 --> 19:16.350
and make something of yourself!

19:16.350 --> 19:17.400
Show them

19:18.600 --> 19:19.640
you're no worse

19:19.640 --> 19:21.500
than any child from the Lu family!

19:41.140 --> 19:41.860
Mom,

19:42.870 --> 19:43.790
you knew

19:43.790 --> 19:45.590
this day would come, didn't you?

19:46.270 --> 19:47.200
We have nothing

19:47.200 --> 19:48.530
to do with them anymore.

19:49.100 --> 19:49.740
We just need to live

19:49.740 --> 19:51.020
our own lives well.

19:52.260 --> 19:53.660
I've thought it through.

19:55.590 --> 19:56.480
I'll find someone

19:56.480 --> 19:57.770
to see the house next week.

19:57.770 --> 19:59.300
This is the lease contract.

20:00.200 --> 20:01.240
Help me check it later

20:01.240 --> 20:02.700
if there are any problems.

20:04.900 --> 20:06.080
When school starts,

20:06.470 --> 20:08.070
I will go to Beijing with you.

21:30.380 --> 21:31.340
Lu Xixiao.

21:33.770 --> 21:34.900
Lu Xixiao!

21:39.300 --> 21:40.460
Where did you go?

21:46.120 --> 21:46.850
For you.

21:51.040 --> 21:52.970
Why didn't you ask me to go with you?

21:53.550 --> 21:54.510
If I brought you along,

21:54.510 --> 21:56.110
would it still be a surprise?

21:56.680 --> 21:57.480
Do you like it?

21:59.960 --> 22:00.650
I like it.

22:05.790 --> 22:08.590
Were you this nervous
because you couldn't see me?

22:10.320 --> 22:13.120
I was afraid your family
would come looking for you.

22:13.120 --> 22:15.050
They didn't contact you, did they?

22:15.720 --> 22:16.640
Even if they come looking for me,

22:16.640 --> 22:17.640
I won't leave.

22:18.330 --> 22:19.400
I promised you.

22:27.170 --> 22:28.970
These flowers are so beautiful.

22:29.890 --> 22:31.550
If we planted them in the yard,

22:33.200 --> 22:34.640
would they stop wilting?

22:35.050 --> 22:35.720
If you like them,

22:35.720 --> 22:36.850
we can just buy more.

22:37.150 --> 22:38.080
It's different.

22:41.960 --> 22:43.510
Your yard looks so empty;

22:43.930 --> 22:45.810
it makes me feel empty too.

22:47.700 --> 22:49.500
Then let's plant them together.

22:55.330 --> 22:56.160
Go change your clothes.

22:56.160 --> 22:57.220
I'm taking you out.

22:58.090 --> 22:58.990
Where to?

23:00.540 --> 23:02.200
You'll know when we get there.

23:12.960 --> 23:13.750
Not bad.

23:13.750 --> 23:15.830
These flowers are quite pretty.

23:17.480 --> 23:19.840
You guys are even holding hands.

23:21.640 --> 23:22.440
Not bad?

23:23.380 --> 23:24.020
Let's celebrate.

23:24.020 --> 23:24.960
Let's have a drink.

23:24.960 --> 23:25.550
Come on.

23:26.790 --> 23:27.310
Cheers.

23:27.310 --> 23:28.470
Cheers.

23:29.160 --> 23:29.960
Wait a minute.

23:30.790 --> 23:31.680
Let's celebrate.

23:31.680 --> 23:32.400
Wait, wait a minute.

23:32.400 --> 23:33.240
What are you two doing?

23:33.240 --> 23:34.240
Let go of your hands.

23:34.240 --> 23:35.110
Let go.

23:35.110 --> 23:35.880
What are you doing?

23:35.880 --> 23:36.480
Move over.

23:36.480 --> 23:37.160
Give me some space.

23:37.160 --> 23:37.590
Wait.

23:37.610 --> 23:38.270
Move over.

23:39.570 --> 23:40.090
Meng,

23:40.380 --> 23:41.200
what's so good about him?

23:41.200 --> 23:42.400
Why do you like him?

23:42.440 --> 23:43.160
You...

23:44.000 --> 23:44.790
Ping, I don't like

23:44.790 --> 23:45.920
how you're talking.

23:45.920 --> 23:47.830
I'm handsome, charismatic,
and I can fight.

23:47.830 --> 23:49.240
Isn't it normal to like me?

23:49.240 --> 23:50.240
Here you go again.

23:50.880 --> 23:52.030
-That's awesome.
-It's true.

23:52.030 --> 23:52.830
Have a drink.

23:52.830 --> 23:53.350
Come on.

23:53.690 --> 23:54.830
Uncle, don't let him drink.

23:54.830 --> 23:56.160
He gets awful when he's drunk.

23:56.160 --> 23:57.110
Just a little, it's fine.

23:57.110 --> 23:57.790
It's fine.

23:58.160 --> 23:59.070
No, seriously.

23:59.400 --> 24:00.640
He's been trying to win you over
all summer.

24:00.640 --> 24:02.640
Why did you only say yes to him today?

24:03.400 --> 24:04.270
This shows that

24:04.270 --> 24:06.140
my sincerity moved the heavens.

24:06.270 --> 24:08.680
This summer I've been
at her beck and call,

24:08.680 --> 24:10.070
not daring to neglect her for a moment.

24:10.070 --> 24:11.240
I heard she was starting school soon,

24:11.240 --> 24:12.550
and I got anxious.

24:13.030 --> 24:13.790
I rode my bike,

24:13.790 --> 24:14.590
carrying a load of flowers,

24:14.590 --> 24:16.000
and parked right downstairs at her place.

24:16.000 --> 24:16.720
As soon as she saw the flowers,

24:16.720 --> 24:17.310
she cried.

24:17.310 --> 24:18.440
-No, no, no.
-That's when she said yes.

24:18.440 --> 24:19.350
It has nothing to do with the flowers.

24:19.350 --> 24:20.270
It has nothing to do with the flowers?

24:20.270 --> 24:21.270
It has nothing to do with the flowers?

24:21.270 --> 24:22.480
Then why didn't you say yes
to me back then,

24:22.480 --> 24:23.790
and why did you suddenly say yes today?

24:23.790 --> 24:25.160
I just don't want this summer

24:25.160 --> 24:27.000
to end with any regrets at all.

24:27.750 --> 24:28.270
Fine.

24:28.270 --> 24:29.480
Since you are all starting school,

24:29.480 --> 24:30.000
I'm the only one

24:30.000 --> 24:31.030
left here.

24:32.240 --> 24:33.270
A lonely man.

24:35.880 --> 24:37.080
I'm not going abroad.

24:37.310 --> 24:38.310
You're bragging.

24:38.640 --> 24:39.440
Don't.

24:39.880 --> 24:41.330
Will your family even agree to that?

24:41.330 --> 24:42.060
I don't know.

24:42.780 --> 24:44.830
I'll talk to my grandpa about it later.

24:44.830 --> 24:45.830
That's great.

24:46.310 --> 24:47.370
I have company now.

24:48.200 --> 24:49.240
Let's drink.

24:50.110 --> 24:52.550
Someone's going to be happy now.

24:52.750 --> 24:53.640
To celebrate me and Gu Meng

24:53.640 --> 24:54.590
officially getting together

24:54.590 --> 24:56.680
and to celebrate Xixiao
not leaving either.

24:56.680 --> 24:57.830
Since you've chosen to be together,

24:57.830 --> 24:58.750
then treat it properly.

24:58.750 --> 25:00.440
Let me go with you tonight.

25:01.450 --> 25:02.450
You shouldn't go.

25:03.810 --> 25:05.540
You'll just get upset if you go.

25:06.000 --> 25:06.480
It tastes awful.

25:06.480 --> 25:07.810
Just wait for me at home.

25:14.490 --> 25:15.890
Could you move over a bit?

25:26.770 --> 25:27.510
Hello.

25:27.650 --> 25:28.780
What would you like?

25:29.640 --> 25:31.250
I'd like to order some flowers.

25:31.250 --> 25:32.770
Take a look first.

25:33.530 --> 25:35.340
♪ Give me some candlelight ♪

25:33.790 --> 25:35.030
Okay, here you go.

25:35.030 --> 25:35.830
If you see any you like,

25:35.830 --> 25:37.040
just put them in here.

25:37.000 --> 25:38.760
♪ Let it illuminate his face ♪

25:37.310 --> 25:37.830
Thank you.

25:37.830 --> 25:38.760
You're welcome.

25:40.110 --> 25:41.510
♪ if your voice is hoarse ♪

25:42.310 --> 25:47.310
[Reserved]

25:42.430 --> 25:44.660
♪ It'll lead to more imaginations ♪

25:46.880 --> 25:48.250
♪ The warm night breeze ♪

25:50.270 --> 25:51.900
♪ Has filled the corridor ♪

25:52.350 --> 25:54.710
[Reserved]

25:53.470 --> 25:55.220
♪ Wet clothes ♪

25:56.270 --> 25:58.670
♪ Flowing waves ♪

26:00.360 --> 26:02.620
♪ Don't think about tomorrow ♪

26:02.740 --> 26:05.060
[Reserved]

26:03.750 --> 26:05.640
♪ Look away in the next second ♪

26:07.010 --> 26:08.540
♪ Tell a long joke ♪

26:10.500 --> 26:12.570
♪ Fill up all the cracks ♪

26:13.820 --> 26:16.300
♪ I don't want to live a wandering life ♪

26:17.390 --> 26:19.490
♪ I don't care what belief he has ♪

26:20.960 --> 26:22.930
♪ What does the world
have to do with me? ♪

26:24.470 --> 26:26.100
♪ It's getting late ♪

26:27.810 --> 26:29.160
♪ His obsession ♪

26:28.890 --> 26:32.400
[Reserved]

26:31.280 --> 26:33.040
♪ Keep everything in mind ♪

26:34.470 --> 26:35.870
♪ The record is spinning ♪

26:37.060 --> 26:38.840
♪ Let me finish this cigarette ♪

26:41.300 --> 26:42.460
♪ Just stay here with me ♪

26:44.640 --> 26:46.440
♪ Even if we just wander around ♪

26:48.010 --> 26:49.350
♪ And do nothing ♪

26:50.320 --> 26:51.240
♪ Go on a date with me ♪

26:52.290 --> 26:56.360
♪ On this Sunday night ♪

27:16.420 --> 27:18.240
When are you coming home?

27:21.730 --> 27:23.990
♪ Don't think about tomorrow ♪

27:24.750 --> 27:25.550
Right away.

27:25.120 --> 27:27.080
♪ Look away in the next second ♪

27:28.380 --> 27:30.050
♪ Tell a long joke ♪

27:30.910 --> 27:32.600
No rush. Take your time.

27:31.870 --> 27:33.940
♪ Fill up all the cracks ♪

27:34.270 --> 27:35.190
When you go home,

27:35.190 --> 27:38.470
♪ I don't want to live a wandering life ♪

27:35.210 --> 27:36.810
I have something to tell you.

27:38.600 --> 27:41.330
♪ I don't care what belief he has ♪

27:41.830 --> 27:44.300
♪ What does the world
have to do with me? ♪

27:45.840 --> 27:47.620
♪ It's getting late ♪

27:49.180 --> 27:50.770
♪ Will you come with me ♪

27:52.300 --> 27:56.770
[Lu Residence]

28:00.210 --> 28:00.720
Mr. Lu,

28:00.790 --> 28:02.650
what brings you here so suddenly?

28:03.030 --> 28:04.540
Can't I come to my own house?

28:04.540 --> 28:05.320
Well...

28:05.640 --> 28:06.680
Where is my father?

28:06.680 --> 28:09.000
He is...

28:13.120 --> 28:14.860
I want to talk to you about a few things.

28:14.860 --> 28:15.490
Go ahead.

28:15.960 --> 28:17.240
As for the first thing,

28:17.260 --> 28:18.940
I've thought it over,

28:19.200 --> 28:20.920
and I've decided to stay in Pingchuan

28:20.920 --> 28:22.050
and study painting.

28:22.880 --> 28:24.240
As for the second,

28:30.310 --> 28:32.170
even though this 10 percent stake

28:34.700 --> 28:36.850
gives me voting rights,

28:38.240 --> 28:40.240
I don't want to take part in the vote.

28:41.350 --> 28:42.590
I still hope

28:42.590 --> 28:44.200
you can stay by my side.

28:45.000 --> 28:46.240
Look at your father.

28:47.070 --> 28:48.690
He's turned this family

28:49.000 --> 28:50.530
upside down all by himself.

29:02.160 --> 29:02.790
I already talked to Grandpa

29:02.790 --> 29:03.880
about the shares.

29:04.430 --> 29:05.960
I will abstain from voting.

29:07.000 --> 29:07.790
I know.

29:08.640 --> 29:10.550
I didn't expect you to do it.

29:11.920 --> 29:13.650
Then what are we talking about?

29:13.830 --> 29:14.720
I'm not going abroad,

29:14.720 --> 29:15.700
and I'm not going back.

29:15.700 --> 29:16.690
Grandpa already agreed.

29:16.690 --> 29:17.480
Stop using your grandpa

29:17.480 --> 29:19.030
as an excuse.

29:19.030 --> 29:20.590
You are a grown man.

29:20.590 --> 29:21.510
Do you think I can tie you up

29:21.510 --> 29:22.510
and drag you back?

29:23.050 --> 29:24.710
Haven't you done that before?

29:25.880 --> 29:27.440
This time, you'll come back

29:27.440 --> 29:28.550
with me willingly.

29:29.070 --> 29:30.870
If you don't think for yourself,

29:31.270 --> 29:33.130
you should at least think for her.

29:33.640 --> 29:34.570
What do you mean?

29:36.440 --> 29:38.030
She pulled that stunt at the wedding

29:38.030 --> 29:39.590
and made me look bad.

29:39.920 --> 29:40.880
Before,

29:41.640 --> 29:44.100
she even extorted money
from Guo Xiangling.

29:46.600 --> 29:48.720
Now, whether this turns into
a big deal or not,

29:48.720 --> 29:50.590
that's entirely up to me.

29:51.240 --> 29:52.590
Zhou Wan's probably having a rough time

29:52.590 --> 29:53.770
these days.

29:54.030 --> 29:54.830
I don't think she'd want to

29:54.830 --> 29:56.000
be called in for questioning.

29:56.000 --> 29:58.130
Whatever you've got, take it out on me.

29:58.680 --> 30:00.410
As long as you come back with me,

30:01.490 --> 30:02.820
she'll be fine.

30:04.030 --> 30:06.000
Uncle Chang said he's been missing you.

30:06.000 --> 30:07.200
I plan to take you

30:07.650 --> 30:10.180
to have a meal with him
the day after tomorrow.

30:12.170 --> 30:13.570
Chang Home Furnishings?

30:16.200 --> 30:17.350
You still don't have his vote,

30:17.350 --> 30:18.030
do you?

30:22.240 --> 30:23.830
Mr. Chang has always believed that
if you can't keep your family together,

30:23.830 --> 30:25.690
you can't run a company properly.

30:25.960 --> 30:27.400
And you just ruined a wedding

30:27.400 --> 30:28.600
right under his nose.

30:29.070 --> 30:30.310
Now you just want to find a chance

30:30.310 --> 30:32.060
to prove to him
that you are a good father.

30:32.060 --> 30:33.660
You guessed it all right.

30:34.750 --> 30:36.000
So what?

30:36.830 --> 30:38.560
Whether to help Zhou Wan or not,

30:38.590 --> 30:40.920
the choice is in your hands.

30:48.460 --> 30:49.860
I'll leave after eating.

30:51.950 --> 30:53.720
I've already arranged everything for you.

30:53.720 --> 30:55.030
After this is over,

30:55.030 --> 30:56.200
you should leave immediately.

30:56.200 --> 30:58.200
Don't waste the plane ticket again.

30:59.240 --> 31:01.100
You're really pushing your luck.

31:02.440 --> 31:04.480
You are the one pushing your luck.

31:05.310 --> 31:07.400
You just get out of here quietly,

31:07.400 --> 31:09.400
and don't come back to make trouble.

31:09.560 --> 31:10.360
Do you hear me?

31:11.720 --> 31:13.270
Or do you really want me

31:13.270 --> 31:15.160
to go find Zhou Wan personally?

31:27.920 --> 31:28.720
Get in the car.

31:47.050 --> 31:48.420
Hand over your phone.

31:49.310 --> 31:49.960
Please.

31:53.670 --> 31:55.750
I already promised you I'd come back.

31:56.550 --> 31:57.610
Is this necessary?

31:58.820 --> 32:00.800
These are troubled times.

32:01.590 --> 32:03.850
I have to prepare for every possibility.

32:05.240 --> 32:07.030
Consider this a lesson from me.

32:11.410 --> 32:12.930
And what makes you think

32:12.960 --> 32:15.220
I'd ever want to learn your cheap tricks?

32:16.400 --> 32:18.310
If you really had a way

32:18.310 --> 32:19.310
to deal with me,

32:19.310 --> 32:21.000
you wouldn't be

32:21.590 --> 32:23.920
standing obediently in front of me today.

32:25.940 --> 32:26.550
Right?

32:29.630 --> 32:31.270
My time is very precious,

32:31.290 --> 32:33.150
and I don't want too much trouble.

32:33.510 --> 32:35.330
Dealing with you is the fastest way

32:35.330 --> 32:36.730
for me to achieve my goal.

32:36.750 --> 32:37.680
But that doesn't mean

32:37.680 --> 32:38.790
I don't have other ways

32:38.790 --> 32:40.350
to solve this problem.

32:40.590 --> 32:42.450
I hope you remember this clearly.

32:42.550 --> 32:43.680
All I want is for you

32:44.000 --> 32:45.830
to learn to take responsibility—

32:45.830 --> 32:46.790
both as a member of the Lu family

32:46.790 --> 32:48.000
and as my son.

32:49.920 --> 32:50.790
So be a good boy

32:50.790 --> 32:52.790
and sit through that dinner with me.

32:53.270 --> 32:56.270
At least until the board vote is over.

32:58.510 --> 33:00.040
I'm afraid my acting skills

33:01.550 --> 33:03.000
aren't good enough to finish playing

33:03.000 --> 33:05.460
this role of a loving father
and a filial son.

33:12.270 --> 33:13.480
If one wants

33:13.480 --> 33:15.070
to get something,

33:15.070 --> 33:15.920
he must

33:15.920 --> 33:17.640
pay an equal price.

33:17.960 --> 33:19.420
If you want to protect her,

33:19.790 --> 33:20.510
then you have to

33:20.510 --> 33:21.720
give up some freedom.

33:22.590 --> 33:24.030
If you don't want to give up your freedom,

33:24.030 --> 33:25.600
then she

33:25.960 --> 33:27.640
will lose some peace.

33:29.080 --> 33:31.000
I'm not forcing you.

33:31.510 --> 33:32.920
I'm teaching you.

33:32.950 --> 33:34.520
If you just

33:35.000 --> 33:35.920
tell me

33:35.920 --> 33:37.900
these few words of nonsense every day,

33:37.900 --> 33:39.040
let's just stop talking,

33:39.040 --> 33:39.680
really.

33:41.880 --> 33:43.000
Stay here.

33:45.340 --> 33:46.600
Keep a close eye on him.

34:58.320 --> 34:59.030
Xixiao,

34:59.350 --> 35:00.480
time for breakfast.

35:07.890 --> 35:09.150
What's for breakfast?

35:10.210 --> 35:11.620
Ham sandwiches,

35:13.960 --> 35:15.820
cherry tomatoed,

35:17.800 --> 35:19.910
and a quinoa salad.

35:21.030 --> 35:22.000
Mr. Lu said

35:22.020 --> 35:23.450
if you step out of the room,

35:23.450 --> 35:24.710
he wouldn't mind inviting Miss Zhou over

35:24.710 --> 35:25.580
for a chat.

35:43.030 --> 35:44.960
Then you should eat while it's hot.

35:45.630 --> 35:46.760
Thank you, Ms. Chen.

36:14.070 --> 36:15.730
You can't contact him either.

36:16.660 --> 36:18.590
It's not the first time
I can't reach him.

36:18.590 --> 36:20.330
His dad doesn't usually care about him.

36:20.330 --> 36:20.880
Whenever he needs

36:20.880 --> 36:21.960
him,

36:22.080 --> 36:23.140
he can do anything.

36:24.030 --> 36:24.960
Do what?

36:26.070 --> 36:27.920
Ground him, take his phone,

36:27.940 --> 36:29.270
and cut off all contact.

36:30.810 --> 36:31.480
When his dad needs

36:31.480 --> 36:32.360
him,

36:33.400 --> 36:34.930
what would he need him to do?

36:35.270 --> 36:36.700
I don't even have the surname Lu.

36:36.700 --> 36:37.830
How would I know?

36:38.480 --> 36:39.560
Useless.

36:40.880 --> 36:41.550
But at home,

36:41.550 --> 36:42.760
at least he's safe.

36:43.400 --> 36:43.920
Besides,

36:43.920 --> 36:44.590
right now, other than waiting,

36:44.590 --> 36:45.790
we can't do anything.

36:47.880 --> 36:48.960
No matter what happens,

36:48.960 --> 36:49.630
no one can force him

36:49.630 --> 36:51.230
to do things he doesn't like.

36:52.000 --> 36:53.200
I'm going to save him.

36:57.210 --> 36:58.770
Even if you go there now,

36:59.440 --> 37:00.770
it'll be hard to see him.

37:05.370 --> 37:07.380
Wait. Why should we tell him?

37:08.710 --> 37:09.800
With one more person knowing,

37:09.800 --> 37:11.550
we have one more brain
to figure things out.

37:11.550 --> 37:12.230
And he's someone
who got a guaranteed admission

37:12.230 --> 37:13.710
to Huaqing University.

37:13.880 --> 37:15.230
So you just plan

37:15.480 --> 37:16.940
to go over there like this?

37:17.550 --> 37:18.110
To a place where he himself

37:18.110 --> 37:19.640
couldn't even escape from?

37:20.190 --> 37:21.670
He has never abandoned me.

37:23.520 --> 37:24.150
How could I possibly

37:24.150 --> 37:25.880
abandon him at a time like this?

37:31.060 --> 37:32.390
Do you really have to go?

37:34.710 --> 37:35.550
I have to.

37:46.140 --> 37:47.740
Then you have to listen to me.

37:51.650 --> 37:52.450
Listen to who?

37:56.310 --> 37:57.090
Listen to me.

38:11.400 --> 38:12.130
You're here.

38:12.640 --> 38:14.170
Mr. Lu is waiting for you in the study.

38:14.170 --> 38:15.380
Okay. Let's go.

38:22.260 --> 38:22.900
Let's go.

39:37.840 --> 39:38.440
What?

39:39.550 --> 39:40.670
Are you okay?

40:32.940 --> 40:34.600
I'm sorry. I broke my promise.

40:34.630 --> 40:35.690
You should go back.

40:39.750 --> 40:41.260
♪ Warm fish tank ♪

40:42.380 --> 40:44.030
♪ Glasses grow ♪

40:44.710 --> 40:46.190
♪ Drowning at dusk ♪

40:44.800 --> 40:45.280
Go!

40:47.490 --> 40:49.330
♪ You came to save me ♪

40:49.360 --> 40:51.170
♪ Just like that ♪

40:52.340 --> 40:56.100
♪ You said it was a weird dream ♪

40:57.700 --> 41:00.640
♪ The sense of deja vu came suddenly♪

41:02.300 --> 41:05.620
♪ 2013, 16 times faster ♪

41:07.090 --> 41:11.180
♪ The night is like a window
and the night is like the ocean ♪

41:12.100 --> 41:16.340
♪ Just like all the memories ♪

41:17.230 --> 41:20.900
♪ It freezes into the bluest dream core ♪

41:18.400 --> 41:19.800
Let's run away together.

41:21.780 --> 41:25.420
♪ Your heart is a rotting one ♪

41:26.440 --> 41:30.530
♪ Soundless and without a trace,
its whereabouts unknown ♪
